      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates integrating previous highs and lows into session planning using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示将前期高低点纳入交易时段计划。"
    },
